## UNIT RESULT

For `status: completed`, submit exactly one proof item under
`## Plan Items Proven`: `- [{{ unit_id }}]`, citing the files changed and the
focused verification result. Do not submit another plan-step or work-unit ID.
Do not invent files or verification results.
Add `Disposition: completed|adapted|not_applicable|blocked`; a blocked assignment requires a partial result. Adapted and not-applicable assignments require reproducible evidence and a rationale showing the request criteria remain covered.

A `status: partial` or `status: failed` result is free-form below the frontmatter — no section or
proof is required, so submit one as soon as you cannot finish rather than
forcing an unprovable completion claim. Use failed when the attempt cannot
proceed. State verified progress or the concrete
blocker, and include `## Next Steps` (the remaining work) and `## Continuation`
(your session ID) so the next iteration can resume.

